- **Edge Cases:** `extensions/matrix/src/matrix/repro_1_3_edge.test.ts` (checks copy + unlink migration when `renameSync` throws `EXDEV`, and verifies that other filesystem errors like `EPERM` do not delete the legacy file).
- **Stress & Concurrency:** `extensions/matrix/src/matrix/repro_1_3_stress.test.ts` (checks that multiple concurrent components calling migration do not crash or corrupt the migration).

